{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/6a597864f13f69cc6ae261dd007fb5a4.poster.avif?t=1771492974\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/6a597864f13f69cc6ae261dd007fb5a4.webm?t=1771492974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Where am I?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approaching headlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as he thought he was about to be hit by a car, time passed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he came to, Mamorukun found himself in a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hi everyone~! Welcome to the Netherworld!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the Netherworld shrine maiden &quot;Jigokudani Fururu, &quot;she summoned &quot;chosen souls&quot; to save the Netherworld from crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignoring the protests of the boys and girls gathered with Mamorukun,Fururu continued her explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, someone is trying to open the gate to the &quot;Dark World&quot; in the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a result, the residents of the Netherworld are cursed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the Netherworld, you must purify the residents and prevent the gate to the Dark World from opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Now, brave ones! Work hard for the Netherworld!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, the battle of Mamorukun and the others, summoned to the Netherworld to return to their original world, begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/01e5503753fdcac1714907a3208ed681.poster.avif?t=1771492974\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/01e5503753fdcac1714907a3208ed681.webm?t=1771492974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main shot, you can use &quot;curse bullets&quot; powered by each character's attached spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quick tap fires a &quot;small curse bullet&quot; that lands directly in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touching the deployed curse field curses both enemies and yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding the button charges a &quot;large curse bullet&quot; that flies far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The initial shockwave can erase enemy bullets and grants brief invincibility!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed enemies continuously take damage. Defeating them yields many score items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're cursed, your power and speed increase for a certain time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, while cursed, you can't shoot curse bullets, and once the curse ends, your power decreases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the power of curses to advance through the vast Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/f3664ab98cc341a410c73b3efa0f3d8e.poster.avif?t=1771492974\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/f3664ab98cc341a410c73b3efa0f3d8e.webm?t=1771492974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6GAME MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode: Play the 2008 arcade version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select stages and tackle missions while managing activity time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode: Introduced in the 2009 home version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch characters and aim to conquer all five worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Netherworld Action Mode: Added in the 2011 home version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose three characters and challenge predetermined courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title includes all past game modes, characters, costumes, and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode now supports widescreen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, it features Gallery Mode and Online Rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/ff952f792e309382c5e7772d3b42539c.poster.avif?t=1771492974\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/ff952f792e309382c5e7772d3b42539c.webm?t=1771492974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6SOUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with the hit track &quot;YO-KAI Disco,&quot; widely known even beyond game fans,this title includes all BGM from the original and arranged versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers a custom function to play your favorite BGM versions by mode or stage,and a sound test to listen to all tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also includes a new theme song by original composer Yousuke Yasui!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Cursed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/a7c4501211305008bad3525fc45d7c56863c7de8.jpg"},{"name":"Cherry Blossom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/fd19386c9258d7c64fab290059090cf4861912a2.jpg"},{"name":"Netherworld Entrance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/995ccf8d04b32e8f21b907bbf15179756e0352d6.jpg"},{"name":"Aerial Garden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/9708dbe1ad02498da99c358f747ceccdf8683550.jpg"},{"name":"Southern Temple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/23d57c9a35d2ceb059ada2cc71eff2fbda1e64b0.jpg"},{"name":"Karakuri Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/7c328faafb0519544ecd6e75d1da9f08f698f2a3.jpg"},{"name":"Victory at last!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/f31356791f688d390178b69c3737c106567c80a1.jpg"},{"name":"The End?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/915868d3e5e1a8f16af334c97ac029e1dde86463.jpg"},{"name":"Cherry Mission!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/658c1abe0df49bfd7d6a9df702a5fe97a096f5f4.jpg"},{"name":"Netherworld Mission!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3273980/0c21cddb4248b8766274e81dc01d6b636c6201b9.jpg"}],"total":46},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273980?t=1771492974","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/5e17ae4081b30f21fe4b6c7572663974d448c502/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771492974","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/bed3a297fe64049abb895de693becf9c197bf1d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771492974","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/bed3a297fe64049abb895de693becf9c197bf1d9/capsul